From 417af641b934f5a3481bc1c3872d9b7ff3eced4d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yiyu Zhou <yiyu@yiyuzhou.io>
Date: Sat, 28 Nov 2026 02:39:46 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 29/47] tty: remove the unused profile

No configuration imports systems/nixos/tty.nix, and none has since it
was added in 2025: router, the one machine without a graphical session,
imports commons.nix directly.  Its only setting, emacs-git-nox as the
package of the Emacs daemon, has therefore never taken effect.
---
 systems/nixos/tty.nix | 5 -----
 1 file changed, 5 deletions(-)
 delete mode 100644 systems/nixos/tty.nix

diff --git a/systems/nixos/tty.nix b/systems/nixos/tty.nix
deleted file mode 100644
index 8359da7..0000000
--- a/systems/nixos/tty.nix
+++ /dev/null
@@ -1,5 +0,0 @@
-{ pkgs, ... }:
-{
-  imports = [ ./commons.nix ];
-  services.emacs.package = pkgs.emacs-git-nox;
-}
-- 
2.56.1

